WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.750 --> 00:00:19.201
"The car wash stinks!" said Jeb.

2
00:00:19.202 --> 00:00:22.049
"This field trip is terrible!"

3
00:00:22.050 --> 00:00:25.185
The car wash made loud sounds.

4
00:00:25.186 --> 00:00:29.808
Hiss! Wump! Wump! Wump!

5
00:00:29.809 --> 00:00:33.691
Poppy was quiet.

6
00:00:33.692 --> 00:00:42.584
She backed away from the building.

7
00:00:42.585 --> 00:00:50.473
"Everyone is dirty," said Mr. Grill.

8
00:00:50.474 --> 00:00:54.269
"I like dirt," said Jeb.

9
00:00:54.270 --> 00:00:57.220
"Dirt feels good," said Eddy.

10
00:00:57.221 --> 00:00:59.782
Mr. Grill smiled.

11
00:00:59.783 --> 00:01:02.074
"I know you like dirt.

12
00:01:02.075 --> 00:01:08.904
But it's time to get clean."

13
00:01:08.905 --> 00:01:12.758
"I like to be clean," said Zippy.

14
00:01:12.759 --> 00:01:22.375
"It helps me go fast!"

15
00:01:22.376 --> 00:01:27.951
Mr. Grill looked at the students.

16
00:01:27.952 --> 00:01:33.499
"Who will go first?" he asked.

17
00:01:33.500 --> 00:01:37.295
Eddy looked at Zippy.

18
00:01:37.296 --> 00:01:39.683
Then he looked at himself.

19
00:01:39.684 --> 00:01:57.746
He saw lots of dirt.

20
00:01:57.747 --> 00:02:03.248
Eddy wanted to be fast.

21
00:02:03.249 --> 00:02:11.353
He looked at Mr. Grill.

22
00:02:11.354 --> 00:02:17.206
"I'll go first," said Eddy.
